### Ajouter à la watchlist - sans token (401 attendu)
POST {{host}}/films/{{filmId}}/watchlist

### Ajouter à la watchlist
POST {{host}}/films/{{filmId}}/watchlist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ajouter le même film - idempotent (204 attendu, pas d'erreur)
POST {{host}}/films/{{filmId}}/watchlist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ajouter un film inexistant (404 attendu)
POST {{host}}/films/999999/watchlist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lister ma watchlist
GET {{host}}/me/watchlist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Retirer de la watchlist
DELETE {{host}}/films/{{filmId}}/watchlist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Retirer un film déjà absent (404 attendu)
DELETE {{host}}/films/{{filmId}}/watchlist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
